==Strategy==
Like most of the other stages in the Aku Citadel, this is a pure Aku stage, so most units that worked well on previous stages would work well here. Meatshields like [[Maize Cat (Rare Cat)|Cone Cat]], [[Ancient Egg: N003 (Special Cat)|Cat Cactus]] and high leveled [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen Cat]] are useful here, since they'll be your main line of defense. It will help a lot to bring Research [[Cat Combo]]s like [[Biohazard (Combo)|Biohazard]] and [[Bony Bone (Combo)|Bony Bone]], or [[Cheating Heart? (Combo)|Cheating Heart?]]/[[Bad Guys (Combo)|Bad Guys]] for players with access to Ubers.

Many of the enemies in this stage have incredibly high HP Shields, so it's strongly recommended that you bring [[Shield Piercing]] units; prime choices for this role are [[Aku Researcher (Rare Cat)|Cat Researcher]], [[Ancient Egg: N109 (Rare Cat)|Barrel Cat]], [[Pied Piper Cat (Rare Cat)|Brass Cat]] and, if timed well, [[Ancient Egg: N004 (Special Cat)|Supercar Cat]]. A less important, but still useful role, is that of a [[Wave Shield]]er, since as Wicked Face's [[Mini-Wave]]s can [[Freeze]] and chip down your backliners.
If you can spare the slot, bring [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]].

[[Master Uril (Special Cat)|Esoteric Uril]] is a very valuable unit to have here, and is one of the only non-Uber cats to work well. He can tank all of the attacks, even going as far as to stalling the entire frontline himself with his powerful DPS utilizing [[Surge Attack]]s. When their Shields are broken, he can CC them with his [[Slow]] and [[Curse]], greatly reducing the difficulty of this stage. As for other non-Ubers, [[Elder Beast Naala (Special Cat)|Awakened Naala]] can work to a certain extent, being [[Immune to Surge|Surge Immune]] and having very high damage—although keep in mind that due to their midranged tendencies, they won't be able to stay alive for as long as Uril. That being said, Naala still has some qualities that can put them on the same level Uril in this stage, like their 3 part Multi-Hit which will be able to snipe Fallen Bear and Ackey, as well as general accessibility.

==='''Recommended Ubers'''===
*[[Kaoru Hanayama (Uber Rare Cat)|Kaoru Hanayama]]: As usual, this Uber can tank the Akus with his absurdly high effective HP, and can turn any Aku he punches into paste, nearly being able to solo the level on his own with Cat Combos.
*[[Yamii (Uber Rare Cat)|Yaminora]]: This unit can tank the enemies here to a certain extent and can block Wicked Face's Waves while [[Weaken]]ing unshielded Akus as a bonus.

